// The monitoring station's record on a company slate (ticket 0014, step 2):
// what the first questline's company ending sells at the board, once, to
// the buyer's `station_record` project line. Nobody makes it and no shelf
// sells it; Corin Hale hands it over when the household agrees to sell. A
// component for its one line, the reading the line is graded on.
(
    id: "veyra:item.station_record",
    name: "Station record",
    maker: "the station",
    kind: Component,
    stack: 1,
    lines: [
        (id: "readings", name: "Readings"),
    ],
    icon: (shape: Slab, color: "#7FC8D8", symbol: Some("veyra:icon.ability.analyse-water")),
)
